# EXPERIMENT (branch experiment/cmu-motion-space): CMU subject-16 1-D speed space.
# Goal: test whether CMU mocap yields a smoother parametric manifold than the
# Credo "Center" corpus -- WITHOUT retargeting. Legal because every example is
# CMU subject 16 (one rig), so the strict skeleton gate passes; this space is a
# standalone graph, NOT blended into the Center hull.
#
# Within-gait (smooth) case: two straight steady walks at different speed.
#   16_31 pathV=17.1 cm/s, window 290-419 (loop-seam score 0.065)
#   16_21 pathV=29.9 cm/s, window  10-129 (loop-seam score 0.050)
# CMU is cm @120fps; cycle joint LeftFoot; contacts via --contact-joints.

node cmu_walk 1
registration cmu_walk LeftFoot - 3 0
parameter_metrics cmu_walk travel_speed
parameter_calibration cmu_walk 9
parameter_support cmu_walk simplex

example cmu_walk 17.1 bvh/16_31.bvh start_frame 290 end_frame 419
example cmu_walk 29.9 bvh/16_21.bvh start_frame 10 end_frame 129

expect cmu_walk spanned_axes 1
